        "original_id": "31014c35-e57a-5d87-88b2-997fdbd6c81f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: K. Shivaram Karanth\n- Products: Marali Mannige\n- Systems: Yakshagana, Shuddha Saveri\n- Topics: Kannada literature, Carnatic music\n\nFacts:\n- K. Shivaram Karanth was born on 10 October 1902 and died on 9 December 1997.\n- K. Shivaram Karanth was a Kannada writer, social activist, environmentalist, Yakshagana artist, filmmaker, and thinker.\n- Yakshagana is a traditional theatre form that combines dance, music, dialogue, costume, make-up, and stage techniques in a distinctive style.\n- Marali Mannige is a Kannada novel by K. Shivaram Karanth.\n- Shuddha Saveri is a rāgam in Carnatic music and Yakshagana music.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
